**Title:** Gentle Waves and Starlit Skies

**Description:** Join Riley, an eleven-year-old with a heart full of wonder, as they meander along a tranquil coastal shoreline with their playful otter companion, Nori. Amidst the soft embrace of the evening breeze and the soothing rhythm of ocean waves, Riley embarks on a serene journey of patience and acceptance. This peaceful narrative paints a vibrant picture of the shoreline at twilight, encouraging a sense of calm and emotional ease. Designed to lull you gently to sleep, this story invites you to breathe deeply, release anxiety, and embrace the unfolding beauty of each moment, just as Riley learns to do.

